'' CONST MEMBERS OF A MODULE'S PUBLIC GENERIC TYPE, called from an importer. Their bodies,
'' spelled 'const function Box( of T ).X( )', were left out of the interface: a call
'' failed to link on the generic's own symbol, BOX::ISSET() const, and 'for each' over a
'' const GetIterator( ) was TKO0606.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 -i toolchains/tiko-windows/inc -i tests/modules/src/genconst/libs tests/modules/src/genconst/app/main.tiko -o tests/modules/genconstlink.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/modules/genconstlink.exe
'' RUN: tests/modules/genconstlink.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: false
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: true
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  42
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  10
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  20
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  2.5
